{"unit_id":"xinyanglii__dsh-skill-curator#card-zh","repo":"xinyanglii/dsh-skill-curator","commit":"e6ce10c71742bec1ffe458d51f6611e1218b0ee9","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-skill-curator 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的技能策展插件，会在后台观察会话并在达到迭代阈值后启动受限子 agent 复盘已完成内容。它把技能写入交给本地 skillctl 校验和记录，并按使用时间整理技能状态；可选地合并相近技能。侧边栏面板可查看技能、复盘历史和活动，并调整自动复盘、整理及合并设置。适合希望从日常会话沉淀并维护本地技能库的 DSH 用户。需要 Node.js、Python 和 zstd；技能库存储在本机。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:194-230","index.js:534-545","scripts/skillctl:636-655","dashboard.js:416-430","client.js:1224-1233"]}
{"unit_id":"xinyanglii__dsh-skill-curator#card-en","repo":"xinyanglii/dsh-skill-curator","commit":"e6ce10c71742bec1ffe458d51f6611e1218b0ee9","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-skill-curator reviews DSH sessions with a restricted child agent and manages reusable skills through a local CLI. It marks or archives idle skills, can optionally consolidate overlaps, and shows the library and review activity in a Web sidebar. Requires Node.js, Python, and zstd.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:194-230","index.js:534-545","scripts/skillctl:636-655","dashboard.js:416-430","client.js:1224-1233"]}
