{"unit_id":"xinyanglii__dsh-skill-curator#feature-1","repo":"xinyanglii/dsh-skill-curator","commit":"e6ce10c71742bec1ffe458d51f6611e1218b0ee9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-skill-curator 的功能「会话后技能复盘」：达到配置的模型迭代阈值后，为已完成会话构建复盘请求并启动受限子 agent。插件监听会话事件触发流程，结果通过 skillctl 管理技能。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:534-545","index.js:1009-1038"]}
{"unit_id":"xinyanglii__dsh-skill-curator#feature-2","repo":"xinyanglii/dsh-skill-curator","commit":"e6ce10c71742bec1ffe458d51f6611e1218b0ee9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-skill-curator 的功能「技能生命周期整理」：周期性检查本地技能使用记录，将长期未使用的技能标记为 stale，达到归档期限时归档；未传 --apply 时只预览变化。由定时 curator 流程启动。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:931-949","scripts/skillctl:743-790"]}
{"unit_id":"xinyanglii__dsh-skill-curator#feature-3","repo":"xinyanglii/dsh-skill-curator","commit":"e6ce10c71742bec1ffe458d51f6611e1218b0ee9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-skill-curator 的功能「技能库仪表盘」：在 Web 客户端侧边栏打开面板，查看技能清单、复盘历史及活动摘要，并修改支持的整理配置。面板通过插件注册的本地 Web 路由读取状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["dashboard.js:416-430","dashboard.js:645-669","client.js:1224-1233"]}
